I open the door.
I come outside.
Then another door also opens.
A woman comes outside.
There is also a small dog there.
That woman is cheerful.
She smiles.
She says, "Hello!"
"My name is Asha."
"This is my dog."
"His name is Moti."
"Are you new here?" she asks.
I say, "Hello!"
"Yes, I am new here."
"My name is Maya."
Asha asks, "Maya, where are you from?"
I say, "I am from Mexico."
Asha says, "Welcome, Maya!"
"Is everything fine?"
I say, "Yes, everything is fine."
"Thank you."
Asha says, "Excellent!"
"Now at night Moti is going outside."
"Good night, Maya."
I also smile.
I say, "Good night, Asha."
